# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on every checkout.
# Windows checkouts previously produced CRLF working trees (core.autocrlf),
# which broke exact-string tests that read committed files via include_str!.
# The repo contains no CRLF-required files (no .bat/.cmd/.ps1), so a global
# LF policy is safe. Binary files are excluded automatically by text=auto.
* text=auto eol=lf
